    {
      "id": "be-s10-procuring-inputs-c3",
      "heading": "Strengths and weaknesses of each method",
      "explanation_md": "| Method | Good | Bad |\n|---|---|---|\n| Spot exchange | Specialization, avoids contracting costs and the costs of vertical integration | Possible **hold-up problem** |\n| Contract | Specialization, reduces opportunism, avoids skimping on specialized investments | **Costly in complex environments** |\n| Vertical integration | Reduces opportunism, avoids contracting costs | **Lost specialization**, may increase organizational costs |",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "Spot: hold-up risk. Contract: costly when complex. Integration: lose specialization.",
      "clarification": null,
